WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.188
Let’s walk through Quick Capture.

00:00:02.188 --> 00:00:05.275
Record one observable point per capture and label whether it

00:00:05.275 --> 00:00:08.213
is an observation, moment, or direct quote.

00:00:08.213 --> 00:00:11.963
Keep interpretation distinct from quoted language and leave formal decisions

00:00:11.963 --> 00:00:13.650
in the artifact workflow.

00:00:13.650 --> 00:00:16.725
On this slide, append observations, key moments,

00:00:16.725 --> 00:00:19.113
and quotes as separate shared entries.

00:00:19.113 --> 00:00:22.688
In practice, write one observable point per capture.

00:00:22.688 --> 00:00:26.300
Distinguish a direct quote from your interpretation and leave formal

00:00:26.300 --> 00:00:28.363
decisions in the Scribe artifact.

00:00:28.860 --> 00:00:31.460
When you are ready, use Open Quick Capture to

00:00:31.460 --> 00:00:33.260
move to the live surface.

00:00:33.260 --> 00:00:35.960
The guide will not make the workflow decision for you

00:00:35.960 --> 00:00:36.110
.
